---
// isiXhosa summary of the terms of use. The English terms are the official ones.
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Prose from "../../components/Prose.astro";
---

<Base title="Imiqathango" description="Isishwankathelo semiqathango yokusebenzisa i-website ye-IsangoTech.">
  <Prose title="Imiqathango (isishwankathelo)">
    <p class="official">
      Esi sisishwankathelo ngesiXhosa. Imiqathango esemthethweni <a href="/terms" lang="en-ZA">ingesiNgesi</a>, kwaye
      ukuba kukho umahluko, isiNgesi siyalawula.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Ulwazi olukule website lulwazi jikelele, aluyongcebiso yeshishini lakho. Amaxabiso abonisiweyo ngamaxabiso
        okuqala; ixabiso lokugqibela liqinisekiswa kwikowuti ebhaliweyo ngaphambi kokuba kuqalwe umsebenzi.
      </li>
      <li>
        Ikowuti isebenza ixesha elibhalwe kuyo. Umsebenzi uqala emva kokuba uyamkele ikowuti kwaye nayiphi na idipozithi
        efunwayo ihlawulwe.
      </li>
      <li>
        Igama le-IsangoTech, ilogo, ipateni yobuhlalu nomxholo wale website zezethu. Nceda ungazikopi ngaphandle
        kwemvume yethu.
      </li>
      <li>
        Asinoxanduva lomxholo wee-website esikhonkxela kuzo, ezifana ne-WhatsApp, i-Google okanye imithombo yeendaba
        zentlalo.
      </li>
      <li>Le miqathango ilawulwa yimithetho yeRiphabhliki yoMzantsi Afrika.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Unemibuzo? <a href="/xh/contact">Qhagamshelana nathi</a>.</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>

<style>
  .official {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--turquoise);
    background: rgb(43 168 160 / 0.08);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
